WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.568 --> 00:00:08.475
&gt;&gt;&gt; SO THIS MORNING MORNING JEREMY
RENNER IS SPEAKING OUT OF HIS

00:00:08.475 --> 00:00:12.445
SNOW PLOW ACCIDENT.
HE POSTED THIS ON INSTAGRAM

00:00:12.445 --> 00:00:17.717
THANKING FANS FOR KIND WORDS.
THE SHERIFF'S OFFICE SAID THE

00:00:17.717 --> 00:00:24.958
ACTOR WAS HELPING A FAMILY
MEMBER NEAR RENO, NEVADA, WHEN

00:00:24.958 --> 00:00:32.098
HIS OWN SNOW PLOW WHICH WEIGHS
MORE THAN 14,000 POUNDS RAN OVER

00:00:32.098 --> 00:00:35.768
HIM.
THE SHERIFF JOINS US NOW WHOSE

00:00:35.768 --> 00:00:37.937
DEPUTIES RESPONDED TO THE
EMERGENCY.

00:00:37.937 --> 00:00:40.907
WE'RE SO GLAD YOU'RE HERE.
GOOD MORNING TO YOU.

00:00:40.907 --> 00:00:43.510
CAN YOU WALK US THROUGH THIS
ACCIDENT SCENE?

00:00:43.510 --> 00:00:46.446
WHEN YOU AND YOUR TEAM ARRIVED,
WHAT WAS HAPPENING?

00:00:46.446 --> 00:00:51.584
&gt;&gt; APPROXIMATELY 8:55 WE
RECEIVED A CALL TO 911 OF A SNOW

00:00:51.584 --> 00:00:55.722
PLOW VERSUS PEDESTRIAN.
FOR US, WE JUST GOT THAT MAJOR

00:00:55.722 --> 00:00:58.257
STORM ON THE WEST COAST.
THERE WAS ABOUT THREE FEET OF

00:00:58.257 --> 00:01:00.994
SNOW AND THE HIGHWAY GOING UP
WAS CLOSED.

00:01:00.994 --> 00:01:07.433
WHEN WE GOT THERE, WHAT WE SAW
WAS MR. RENNER AND HIS SNOW CAT.

00:01:07.433 --> 00:01:12.138
HE HAD BEEN PLOWING HIS
NEIGHBOR, HIS PRIVATE ROAD.

00:01:12.138 --> 00:01:18.144
HE UNSTUCK ONE OF HIS FAMILY
MEMBERS AND HE NOTICED THE

00:01:18.144 --> 00:01:22.215
PISTON BULLY STARTED TO MOVE.
HE WENT TO GO BACK INTO THE SNOW

00:01:22.215 --> 00:01:27.754
PLOW TO STOP IT.
A FAMILY MEMBER AND WITNESSES

00:01:27.754 --> 00:01:31.524
SAW HIM GET INTO THE CAB AND
THEN HE DISAPPEARS.

00:01:31.524 --> 00:01:35.995
LATER HE'S FOUND ON THE MIDDLE
OF THE ROAD AS THE SNOW PLOW

00:01:35.995 --> 00:01:40.433
PASSED HIM AND RAN HIM OVER.
THE FAMILY MEMBER QUICKLY RAN TO

00:01:40.433 --> 00:01:42.335
A NEIGHBOR'S HOUSE.
ASKED FOR HELP.

00:01:42.335 --> 00:01:48.975
THOSE NEIGHBORS CAME OUT WITH
SOME TOWELS AND THEN FIRE FROM

00:01:48.975 --> 00:01:54.614
THE FIRE PROTECTION CAME DOWN
AND WE CARE FLIGHTED HIM.

00:01:54.614 --> 00:01:58.985
HE WAS SPEAKING WHEN OUR
DEPUTIES ARRIVED ON SCENE.

00:01:58.985 --> 00:02:01.688
FOR WHAT JUST OCCURRED, HE WAS
IN GOOD SPIRITS.

00:02:01.688 --> 00:02:05.825
&gt;&gt; WHAT WAS HE SAYING?
&gt;&gt; YOU KNOW, I DIDN'T GET WHAT

00:02:05.825 --> 00:02:11.064
HE WAS SAYING TO THE DEPUTIES OR
THE FIRE, BUT I KNOW HE WAS

00:02:11.064 --> 00:02:13.499
CONVERSING WITH THEM WHEN I
TALKED TO THEM.

00:02:13.499 --> 00:02:17.470
IF I HAD TO ASSUME, HE WAS
PROBABLY IN A BIT OF SHOCK, BUT

00:02:17.470 --> 00:02:19.505
HE WAS AWAKE AND SPEAKING TO
THEM.

00:02:19.505 --> 00:02:23.009
&gt;&gt; ONE THING I LOVE ABOUT --
THAT I LEARNED ABOUT HIM SINCE

00:02:23.009 --> 00:02:26.746
THIS HAPPENED IS WHAT A BIG PART
HE IS AND BIG FAN HE IS OF THE

00:02:26.746 --> 00:02:34.153
COMMUNITY.
HE'S CALLED A RENO-KNIGHT.

00:02:34.153 --> 00:02:37.357
HE'S SUCH AN ADVOCATE.
&gt;&gt; HE IS.

00:02:37.357 --> 00:02:41.728
HE'S ONE OF OUR HONORARY
DEPUTIES AT THE SHERIFF'S OFFICE

00:02:41.728 --> 00:02:47.734
AND HE HELPS US DO SHOP WITH A
SHERIFF WHERE THEY DONATE

00:02:47.734 --> 00:02:50.103
$50,000.
HE'S ONE OF THOSE MEMBERS.

00:02:50.103 --> 00:02:58.177
HE DOES A LOT FOR THE COMMUNITY.
WHEN I TOOK OFFICE IN 2019, HE

00:02:58.177 --> 00:03:02.948
SHOWED UP FOR SHOP WITH A
SHERIFF.

00:03:02.948 --> 00:03:05.118
HE SIGNED AUTOGRAPHS, SHOPPED
WITH KIDS.

00:03:05.118 --> 00:03:09.055
WHAT I TRULY ENJOY ABOUT
MR. RENNER, A LOT OF TIMES HE

00:03:09.055 --> 00:03:13.126
DOES IT AND NO ONE KNOWS.
IT'S OUT OF THE KINDNESS OF HIS

00:03:13.126 --> 00:03:16.362
HEART HE WANTS TO MAKE AN
IMPACT.

00:03:16.362 --> 00:03:19.132
WE'RE GLAD HE'S OKAY AND ON A
SPEEDY RECOVERY.

00:03:19.132 --> 00:03:24.837
HE LOVES OUR COMMUNITY.
&gt;&gt; IF NOT FOR THAT CUSHION OF

00:03:24.837 --> 00:03:29.409
SNOW, THERE WAS A BIG CUSHION OF
SNOW THERE AND I'M SURE THAT

00:03:29.409 --> 00:03:30.576
HELPED.
AM I WRONG?

00:03:30.576 --> 00:03:34.080
&gt;&gt; IT DID.
IT WAS JUST ONE OF THOSE TRAGIC

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:36.816
EVENTS.
THAT'S WHY WE DID THE PRESS

00:03:36.816 --> 00:03:39.018
CONFERENCE YESTERDAY BECAUSE
THERE WAS A LOT OF

00:03:39.018 --> 00:03:41.554
MISINFORMATION.
IT WAS JUST A TRAGIC ACCIDENT.

00:03:41.554 --> 00:03:45.024
THANK GOODNESS EVERYONE WAS
WATCHING OUT FOR HIM AND HE'S ON

00:03:45.024 --> 00:03:47.226
THE MEND.
&gt;&gt; AMEN.

00:03:47.226 --> 00:03:49.962
&gt;&gt; AMEN.
&gt;&gt; THANK YOU, SHERIFF.

00:03:49.962 --> 00:03:52.965
&gt;&gt; THANK YOU GUYS.
HAVE A GREAT DAY.

00:03:52.965 --> 00:03:53.465
&gt;&gt; TAKE CARE. 

